From: Raspberry-Monster <lele2194512339@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 21:02:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: amlogic: add RTL8723DS and MiBox 4

Signed-off-by: Raspberry-Monster <lele2194512339@outlook.com>
